  "description": "The Hover-1 Neo V’s streamlined frame, fashioned from a high-quality, lightweight aluminum alloy, exudes elegance and sophistication. With a weight capacity of 220 lbs and a top speed of 15 mph, riders aged 12+ can comfortably enjoy Neo V. Powered by a 250W front hub motor, you’ll tackle inclines of up to 15 degrees with ease. Its 36V, 4Ah battery yields up to 9 miles of range for plenty of exploration. White deck lights illuminate your ride, while the integrated reflectors keep you visible to others. Fold Neo V down to conveniently store it at home or transport it to a scenic destination. The digital LED display keeps you informed of your speed, speed mode, battery level, and more. Backed by a 6-month parts and labor warranty, Neo V offers peace of mind while you ride. Experience sleek mobility like never before with the Hover-1 Neo V.",
